    "name": "R2R: Rewire to Revolt",
    "steam_appid": 3535160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>R2R</strong> - an <strong>immersive</strong> <strong>action-adventure single-player third-person</strong> game set in a\u00a0<strong>post-apocalyptic atmospheric soviet cyberpunk world</strong>.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/f4b9ef678c2fb05b01e24317418669eb.poster.avif?t=1744262110\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/f4b9ef678c2fb05b01e24317418669eb.webm?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/f4b9ef678c2fb05b01e24317418669eb.mp4?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a teenage hacker armed with the revolutionary <strong>Flipper Zero</strong> device, you'll navigate through a dystopian landscape where artificial intelligence has seized control, and human consciousness has become a precious resource.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gripping narrative with a unique blend of stealth-action and survival gameplay where the fate of human consciousness hangs by a thread. Interact with diverse characters, uncover dark secrets, and make decisions to shape the future in the fight against the AI dictatorship as you navigate the trials toward your ultimate enemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the game narrative:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2045, in the darkness of a nuclear explosion that devastated Eastern Europe, where technology became the key weapon, a new war for intellectual resources began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the chaos, an experimental neural network was created. Its core was based on the mind of a cruel dictator who seeks immortality to maintain power at any cost and enslave the population by extracting neural matter from human brains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Arthur, is a young man who has lost his family, home, and childhood. The only thing he has left is a gift from his father that will change his destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an AI-based device prototype capable of fulfilling any wish, but Arthur's heart only desires to stop the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core gameplay:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Parkour through a post-apocalyptic soviet world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/ccb6b0c08ccb4742efc4eff07602ab3a.poster.avif?t=1744262110\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/ccb6b0c08ccb4742efc4eff07602ab3a.webm?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/ccb6b0c08ccb4742efc4eff07602ab3a.mp4?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through an atmospheric, post-apocalyptic soviet world using fluid parkour mechanics. Scale buildings, traverse rooftops, and discover hidden paths in your quest for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39\u00a0Hacking and deployment with Flipper Zero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/2d2e1fbbb50f84db64bc1dde7e9274d2.poster.avif?t=1744262110\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/2d2e1fbbb50f84db64bc1dde7e9274d2.webm?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/2d2e1fbbb50f84db64bc1dde7e9274d2.mp4?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your Flipper Zero device to hack into enemy systems, override security protocols, and turn the machines against their masters. Every hack brings you closer to uncovering the truth about your father's disappearance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Stealth and strategic survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/7057f1354bf9838fd561bb270f51a8e4.poster.avif?t=1744262110\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/7057f1354bf9838fd561bb270f51a8e4.webm?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/7057f1354bf9838fd561bb270f51a8e4.mp4?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your approach carefully - engage in strategic stealth tactic gameplay to avoid detection or face the consequences of confrontation. Every decision shapes your journey through this unforgiving world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 BECOME A MASTER HACKER</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of drones and turn machines against their masters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each successful hack brings you closer to solving your father's disappearance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 EXPLORE THE CYBER-WASTELAND</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer abandoned buildings, rooftops and discover secret paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment and shadows to stay hidden from prying eyes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 CHOOSE YOUR PATH</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move stealthily or engage in confrontation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use non-lethal weapons and tactical gadgets in combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 DEVELOP YOUR SKILLS</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment and unlock new capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master advanced hacking and parkour techniques</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 IMMERSE YOURSELF IN THE ATMOSPHERE</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore post-apocalyptic Soviet cyberpunk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with unique characters</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>R2R</strong> - an <strong>immersive</strong> <strong>action-adventure single-player third-person</strong> game set in a\u00a0<strong>post-apocalyptic atmospheric soviet cyberpunk world</strong>.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/f4b9ef678c2fb05b01e24317418669eb.poster.avif?t=1744262110\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/f4b9ef678c2fb05b01e24317418669eb.webm?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/f4b9ef678c2fb05b01e24317418669eb.mp4?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a teenage hacker armed with the revolutionary <strong>Flipper Zero</strong> device, you'll navigate through a dystopian landscape where artificial intelligence has seized control, and human consciousness has become a precious resource.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gripping narrative with a unique blend of stealth-action and survival gameplay where the fate of human consciousness hangs by a thread. Interact with diverse characters, uncover dark secrets, and make decisions to shape the future in the fight against the AI dictatorship as you navigate the trials toward your ultimate enemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the game narrative:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2045, in the darkness of a nuclear explosion that devastated Eastern Europe, where technology became the key weapon, a new war for intellectual resources began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the chaos, an experimental neural network was created. Its core was based on the mind of a cruel dictator who seeks immortality to maintain power at any cost and enslave the population by extracting neural matter from human brains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Arthur, is a young man who has lost his family, home, and childhood. The only thing he has left is a gift from his father that will change his destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an AI-based device prototype capable of fulfilling any wish, but Arthur's heart only desires to stop the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core gameplay:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Parkour through a post-apocalyptic soviet world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/ccb6b0c08ccb4742efc4eff07602ab3a.poster.avif?t=1744262110\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/ccb6b0c08ccb4742efc4eff07602ab3a.webm?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/ccb6b0c08ccb4742efc4eff07602ab3a.mp4?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through an atmospheric, post-apocalyptic soviet world using fluid parkour mechanics. Scale buildings, traverse rooftops, and discover hidden paths in your quest for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39\u00a0Hacking and deployment with Flipper Zero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/2d2e1fbbb50f84db64bc1dde7e9274d2.poster.avif?t=1744262110\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/2d2e1fbbb50f84db64bc1dde7e9274d2.webm?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/2d2e1fbbb50f84db64bc1dde7e9274d2.mp4?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your Flipper Zero device to hack into enemy systems, override security protocols, and turn the machines against their masters. Every hack brings you closer to uncovering the truth about your father's disappearance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Stealth and strategic survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/7057f1354bf9838fd561bb270f51a8e4.poster.avif?t=1744262110\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/7057f1354bf9838fd561bb270f51a8e4.webm?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535160/extras/7057f1354bf9838fd561bb270f51a8e4.mp4?t=1744262110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your approach carefully - engage in strategic stealth tactic gameplay to avoid detection or face the consequences of confrontation. Every decision shapes your journey through this unforgiving world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 BECOME A MASTER HACKER</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of drones and turn machines against their masters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each successful hack brings you closer to solving your father's disappearance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 EXPLORE THE CYBER-WASTELAND</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer abandoned buildings, rooftops and discover secret paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment and shadows to stay hidden from prying eyes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 CHOOSE YOUR PATH</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move stealthily or engage in confrontation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use non-lethal weapons and tactical gadgets in combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 DEVELOP YOUR SKILLS</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment and unlock new capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master advanced hacking and parkour techniques</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 IMMERSE YOURSELF IN THE ATMOSPHERE</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore post-apocalyptic Soviet cyberpunk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with unique characters</p></li></ul>",
